            "pp_expandable_content1": "<p><p>Enjoy insured shipping on all orders. We process orders within 1-3 business days before dispatching. Upon shipment, the anticipated delivery times are as follows:</p><ul><li>USA: 3-7 business days</li><li>UK: 7-18 business days</li><li>Australia: 7-18 business days</li><li>Canada: 7-18 business days</li><li>Europe: 7-18 business days</li><li>Rest of world: 14-20 business days</li></ul></p>",
